Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"clickhouse__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（列存+多编码+ZSTD，高压缩比）。 列式存储 + 按列类型自适应编码（Delta、Gorilla、T64 等）+ 通用压缩（ZSTD/LZ4），压缩比常达 5-10 倍。官方文档 MergeTree 引擎的压缩为表级可配置，支持按列指定压缩算法。官方文档 高压缩比是其核心卖点之一，社区实测与官方口径基本一致。社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（列存+多编码+ZSTD，高压缩比）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>列式存储 + 按列类型自适应编码（Delta、Gorilla、T64 等）+ 通用压缩（ZSTD/LZ4），压缩比常达 5-10 倍。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MergeTree 引擎的压缩为表级可配置，支持按列指定压缩算法。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>高压缩比是其核心卖点之一，社区实测与官方口径基本一致。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Columnar with multi-encoding plus ZSTD; high ratios). Columnar storage with per-type adaptive encodings (Delta, Gorilla, T64, etc.) plus general compression (Z…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Columnar with multi-encoding plus ZSTD; high ratios).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Columnar storage with per-type adaptive encodings (Delta, Gorilla, T64, etc.) plus general compression (ZSTD/LZ4) routinely reaches 5-10x ratios. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MergeTree compression is table-level configurable with per-column codec selection. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>High compression ratio is a core selling point; community measurements largely match official claims. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（Apache 2.0 开源；云版闭源）。 ClickHouse 核心采用 Apache 2.0 开源，GitHub 公开，无协议变更黑历史。官方文档 ClickHouse Cloud 为闭源托管服务，存在云绑定，但自建版功能对等。厂商口径 生态工具（驱动、可视化）多为开放实现，迁出成本低。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（Apache 2.0 开源；云版闭源）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse 核心采用 Apache 2.0 开源，GitHub 公开，无协议变更黑历史。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud 为闭源托管服务，存在云绑定，但自建版功能对等。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>生态工具（驱动、可视化）多为开放实现，迁出成本低。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Apache 2.0 open source; cloud edition closed). The ClickHouse core is open source under Apache 2.0 with a public GitHub repo and no license-change history.…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Apache 2.0 open source; cloud edition closed).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The ClickHouse core is open source under Apache 2.0 with a public GitHub repo and no license-change history. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud is a closed-source managed service with cloud binding, but the self-hosted edition is feature-equivalent. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Ecosystem tooling (drivers, visualization) is mostly open, keeping migration-out cost low. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（CBO 持续增强；SETTINGS 调优无 hint）。 24.x 起 CBO 大幅增强，EXPLAIN 完备 官方文档。 无传统 hint 语法，靠 SETTINGS 逐查询调优 官方文档。 分析场景计划翻转少，但 JOIN 顺序选错仍是慢查询主因 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（CBO 持续增强；SETTINGS 调优无 hint）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>24.x 起 CBO 大幅增强，EXPLAIN 完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无传统 hint 语法，靠 SETTINGS 逐查询调优 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分析场景计划翻转少，但 JOIN 顺序选错仍是慢查询主因 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Growing CBO; SETTINGS-based tuning, no classic hints). CBO greatly improved since 24.x; full EXPLAIN <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No classic hint syntax; per-query tuning …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Growing CBO; SETTINGS-based tuning, no classic hints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CBO greatly improved since 24.x; full EXPLAIN <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No classic hint syntax; per-query tuning via SETTINGS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Plan flips are rare in analytics, but bad JOIN order still tops slow-query causes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（上百 settings；调优靠建模）。 settings 上百，核心在建表（排序键、分区、TTL）而非运行时参数 官方文档。 parts 合并、内存配额是常规调优点，自治能力弱 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（上百 settings；调优靠建模）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>settings 上百，核心在建表（排序键、分区、TTL）而非运行时参数 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>parts 合并、内存配额是常规调优点，自治能力弱 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (100+ settings; tuning lives in modeling). 100+ settings, but the real tuning is table design (sorting key, partitioning, TTL) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Part merges and me…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (100+ settings; tuning lives in modeling).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>100+ settings, but the real tuning is table design (sorting key, partitioning, TTL) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Part merges and memory quotas are routine tuning; weak autonomy <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（MergeTree 自带校验文件，合并时验证）。 MergeTree 数据 part 目录含 checksums.txt，加载与合并时校验数据文件完整性。社区实测 无用户可配的常驻页校验开关；副本间一致性靠 ZooKeeper/keeper 协调与重建。社区共识 损坏的 part 可被隔离丢弃，但自动检测覆盖范围不如页级校验完整…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（MergeTree 自带校验文件，合并时验证）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MergeTree 数据 part 目录含 checksums.txt，加载与合并时校验数据文件完整性。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>无用户可配的常驻页校验开关；副本间一致性靠 ZooKeeper/keeper 协调与重建。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>损坏的 part 可被隔离丢弃，但自动检测覆盖范围不如页级校验完整。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (MergeTree checksums.txt verified on merge). MergeTree data parts include checksums.txt, verified when parts load and merge. (community tested) No user-configurab…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (MergeTree checksums.txt verified on merge).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MergeTree data parts include checksums.txt, verified when parts load and merge. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>No user-configurable always-on page checksum switch; replica consistency relies on ZooKeeper/keeper coordination and rebuilds. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Corrupt parts can be quarantined and dropped, but automatic detection coverage is less complete than page-level checks. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。 无存储过程、触发器（查证为无）官方文档。 逻辑放在 ETL/应用层，物化视图承担部分预计算 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无存储过程、触发器（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>逻辑放在 ETL/应用层，物化视图承担部分预计算 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no procedures/triggers). No stored procedures or triggers (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Logic lives in ETL/app; materialized views cover som…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no procedures/triggers).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No stored procedures or triggers (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Logic lives in ETL/app; materialized views cover some precomputation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（MergeTree 无外键/CHECK）。 无外键、CHECK、唯一约束（查证为无）官方文档。 数据质量靠写入链路（Kafka/ETL）保证 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（MergeTree 无外键/CHECK）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无外键、CHECK、唯一约束（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>数据质量靠写入链路（Kafka/ETL）保证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No FK/CHECK on MergeTree). No FK, CHECK, or unique constraints (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Data quality enforced in the ingestion path (Kafka/ETL) (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No FK/CHECK on MergeTree).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No FK, CHECK, or unique constraints (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Data quality enforced in the ingestion path (Kafka/ETL) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（窗口/GROUPING SETS 完备）。 窗口函数、GROUPING SETS/CUBE/ROLLUP、数组/元组函数完备 官方文档。 方言与标准 SQL 有差异，迁移时函数需适配 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（窗口/GROUPING SETS 完备）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口函数、GROUPING SETS/CUBE/ROLLUP、数组/元组函数完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>方言与标准 SQL 有差异，迁移时函数需适配 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Strong windows/GROUPING SETS). Strong window functions, GROUPING SETS/CUBE/ROLLUP, array/tuple functions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Dialect differs from standard SQL; fu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Strong windows/GROUPING SETS).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong window functions, GROUPING SETS/CUBE/ROLLUP, array/tuple functions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Dialect differs from standard SQL; functions need porting <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（轻量DELETE；分区DROP最彻底）。 ClickHouse 的 DELETE 是“变异”（mutation），异步重写 part，大表代价高 官方文档 ALTER TABLE ... DROP PARTITION 是最高效彻底的批量擦除 社区实测 旧 part 在 mutation 完成前残留；备份与 S3 归档延长残留期 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（轻量DELETE；分区DROP最彻底）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse 的 DELETE 是“变异”（mutation），异步重写 part，大表代价高 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ALTER TABLE ... DROP PARTITION 是最高效彻底的批量擦除 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>旧 part 在 mutation 完成前残留；备份与 S3 归档延长残留期 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Lightweight DELETE; partition DROP is cleanest). ClickHouse DELETE is a mutation that asynchronously rewrites parts, expensive on large tables <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> AL…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Lightweight DELETE; partition DROP is cleanest).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse DELETE is a mutation that asynchronously rewrites parts, expensive on large tables <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ALTER TABLE ... DROP PARTITION is the most efficient and thorough bulk erasure <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>Old parts persist until the mutation completes; backups and S3 archives extend the residue window <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生；OpenLineage 第三方集成）。 无原生血缘，需 OpenLineage/Marquez 等第三方集成 社区共识。 query_log 可作为血缘采集的数据源 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生；OpenLineage 第三方集成）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生血缘，需 OpenLineage/Marquez 等第三方集成 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>query_log 可作为血缘采集的数据源 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native; third-party OpenLineage integration). No native lineage; integrate OpenLineage/Marquez via third parties <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. query_log can serve as…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native; third-party OpenLineage integration).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native lineage; integrate OpenLineage/Marquez via third parties <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>query_log can serve as a lineage data source <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——原生 BACKUP/RESTORE SQL（22.8+），可备份到本地盘与对象存储；生态常用 clickhouse-backup 工具。但分片集群的一致备份点、恢复并发、Keeper 元数据的重建都需要 runbook 与实际演练；本轮未找到可引用的恢复速度数字，不写。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + 社区实践。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——原生 <code>BACKUP</code>/<code>RESTORE</code> SQL（22.8+），可备份到本地盘与对象存储；生态常用 <code>clickhouse-backup</code> 工具。但分片集群的一致备份点、恢复并发、Keeper 元数据的重建都需要 runbook 与实际演练；本轮未找到可引用的恢复速度数字，不写。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + 社区实践。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — native BACKUP/RESTORE SQL (22.8+), targets local disk and object storage; clickhouse-backup is the common ecosystem tool. But consistent backup points for sha…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — native <code>BACKUP</code>/<code>RESTORE</code> SQL (22.8+), targets local disk and object storage; <code>clickhouse-backup</code> is the common ecosystem tool. But consistent backup points for sharded clusters, restore concurrency, and Keeper metadata rebuild all need a runbook and real rehearsals; no citable restore-speed figures were found this round — none are given. Evidence: official docs + community practices.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（开源存算一体；Cloud 版存算分离）。 开源版经典存算一体：本地盘 MergeTree，高吞吐 官方文档。 ClickHouse Cloud 采用存算分离（对象存储）官方文档。 自建分离存储方案成熟度不如云版 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（开源存算一体；Cloud 版存算分离）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源版经典存算一体：本地盘 MergeTree，高吞吐 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud 采用存算分离（对象存储）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>自建分离存储方案成熟度不如云版 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (OSS coupled; Cloud disaggregated). OSS is classic coupled: local-disk MergeTree, high throughput <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. ClickHouse Cloud uses disaggregated object st…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (OSS coupled; Cloud disaggregated).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OSS is classic coupled: local-disk MergeTree, high throughput <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud uses disaggregated object storage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Self-hosted disaggregated setups lag the cloud edition in maturity <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（列存+JSON+倒排全文+向量索引）。 JSON/Object 类型、倒排索引（全文）、向量索引（ANN）均已支持 官方文档。 无图引擎；超大规模向量检索仍不如专用库 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（列存+JSON+倒排全文+向量索引）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON/Object 类型、倒排索引（全文）、向量索引（ANN）均已支持 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无图引擎；超大规模向量检索仍不如专用库 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Columnar + JSON + inverted full-text + vector index). JSON/Object types, inverted indexes (full-text), and vector (ANN) indexes all supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Columnar + JSON + inverted full-text + vector index).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON/Object types, inverted indexes (full-text), and vector (ANN) indexes all supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No graph engine; hyperscale vector search still favors dedicated stores <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（自建无计费，成本=硬件+运维人力自理）。 开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。社区共识 ClickHouse Cloud 等托管版可在云账单侧做标签归因与预算告警。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（自建无计费，成本=硬件+运维人力自理）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud 等托管版可在云账单侧做标签归因与预算告警。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; hardware plus labor). Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Ma…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; hardware plus labor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Managed editions (e.g. ClickHouse Cloud) expose cost attribution and budget alerts on the billing side. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（HTTP 原生+JDBC/ODBC+各语言客户端）。 HTTP 接口是一等公民，clickhouse-jdbc/ODBC 完备 官方文档。 Python/Go/Node/JS 官方或社区客户端成熟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（HTTP 原生+JDBC/ODBC+各语言客户端）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTP 接口是一等公民，clickhouse-jdbc/ODBC 完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Python/Go/Node/JS 官方或社区客户端成熟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native HTTP + JDBC/ODBC + language clients). HTTP interface is first-class; clickhouse-jdbc/ODBC complete <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mature Python/Go/Node/JS official or…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native HTTP + JDBC/ODBC + language clients).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTP interface is first-class; clickhouse-jdbc/ODBC complete <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Mature Python/Go/Node/JS official or community clients <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（触发器式物化视图，语义特殊）。 物化视图为增量触发器语义（TO 内表），聚合预计算强大 官方文档。 语义与传统 MV 差异大（无查询自动改写、写入即触发），误用易出错 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（触发器式物化视图，语义特殊）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>物化视图为增量触发器语义（TO 内表），聚合预计算强大 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>语义与传统 MV 差异大（无查询自动改写、写入即触发），误用易出错 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Trigger-style MVs, special semantics). Trigger-style incremental MVs (TO inner table), strong for pre-aggregation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Semantics differ from classi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Trigger-style MVs, special semantics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Trigger-style incremental MVs (TO inner table), strong for pre-aggregation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantics differ from classic MVs (no auto rewrite); misuse is error-prone <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（开源任意云；ClickHouse Cloud 多云）。 开源版任意云可部署 官方文档。 ClickHouse Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP/Azure 官方文档。 跨云用 remote 表函数/复制表可配，无一键方案 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（开源任意云；ClickHouse Cloud 多云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源版任意云可部署 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP/Azure <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云用 remote 表函数/复制表可配，无一键方案 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Open source on any cloud; ClickHouse Cloud multi-cloud). Open source deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. ClickHouse Cloud supports AWS/GCP/Azure (official do…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Open source on any cloud; ClickHouse Cloud multi-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open source deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud supports AWS/GCP/Azure <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud via remote table functions / replicated tables; no one-click story <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（点更新按 part 重写，确认无热点机制）。 并发控制原语：MergeTree part 不可变，无行锁、文档锁、in-place 更新概念——热点点更新根本不是“并发冲突”问题，而是“重写”问题：ALTER TABLE ... UPDATE/DELETE 是异步后台 mutation 任务（mutations_sync 控制客户端是…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（点更新按 part 重写，确认无热点机制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发控制原语：MergeTree part 不可变，无行锁、文档锁、in-place 更新概念——热点点更新根本不是“并发冲突”问题，而是“重写”问题：<code>ALTER TABLE ... UPDATE/DELETE</code> 是异步后台 mutation 任务（<code>mutations_sync</code> 控制客户端是否等待完成），并发提交的 mutation 按提交顺序执行，无锁等待、无冲突检测、无 abort<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>冲突行为：不存在写冲突 abort 或死锁——同一 key 的“并发更新”只是多个后台重写任务顺序追加，互不阻塞；重试归属：只有 mutation 提交失败才需应用层重提（mutation 本身无内核重试），进度走 <code>system.mutations</code> 查询；频繁小 mutation 的冲突面是任务队列积压而非锁<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态：mutation 按受影响 part 的大小重写（非按行数）——更新 1 行若横跨 100 个 part 就重写 100 个 part：写放大、磁盘 IO 尖峰、拖慢后台 merge 与无关查询；热点 key 高频更新是架构级反模式：mutation 积压、part 数与合并压力随热度膨胀，吞吐不随并发度提升<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解：确认无官方命名或文档化的热点行机制——MergeTree 的 part 重写设计本身决定了高频点更新是反模式。ReplacingMergeTree（按排序键后台去重，<code>FINAL</code>/<code>argMax</code> 取最新版）与轻量更新（patch parts：只写变更补丁 part 不立即重写，约 23.3 引入实验性、25.x 文档列为常规用法、官方约 10% 行适用上限）只是建模替代而非内核热点机制：去重延迟到 merge（有读到旧版的窗口），无自动打散或排队化<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式与代价：热点状态（库存、计数器）不要逐行 UPDATE——攒批重插新版本（代价：秒到分钟级新鲜度延迟）；热 key 的变更流在应用层/流处理中先聚合再批量写入（代价：架构复杂度）；真需要 OLTP 行级语义用 OLTP 库，ClickHouse 只做分析（代价：双写/同步链路）。结论：同一行的高频点更新确认无原生承载路径<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Point updates rewrite whole parts; no hotspot mechanism). The concurrency primitive: MergeTree parts are immutable — there are no row locks, document locks…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Point updates rewrite whole parts; no hotspot mechanism).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive: MergeTree parts are immutable — there are no row locks, document locks, or in-place updates. Hotspot point updates are not a &quot;concurrency conflict&quot; problem at all but a &quot;rewrite&quot; problem: <code>ALTER TABLE ... UPDATE/DELETE</code> is an asynchronous background mutation (<code>mutations_sync</code> controls whether the client waits), and concurrently submitted mutations execute in submission order with no lock waiting, no conflict detection, and no aborts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Conflict behavior: there are no write-conflict aborts or deadlocks — &quot;concurrent updates&quot; to one key are just sequential background rewrite tasks that never block each other. Retry ownership: only a failed mutation submission needs application resubmission (mutations have no core-level retry); check progress via <code>system.mutations</code>. The conflict surface of frequent small mutations is task-queue backlog, not locks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Decay shape: a mutation rewrites parts proportional to the affected parts&#x27; size, not the row count — updating one row spread across 100 parts rewrites all 100: write amplification, disk IO spikes, and slowed background merges plus unrelated queries. High-frequency updates to a hot key are an architectural anti-pattern: mutation backlogs, part counts, and merge pressure grow with heat while throughput does not improve with concurrency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation: confirmed that there is no officially named or documented hotspot-row mechanism — MergeTree&#x27;s part-rewrite design itself makes high-frequency point updates an anti-pattern. ReplacingMergeTree (background deduplication on the sorting key, latest version via <code>FINAL</code>/<code>argMax</code>) and lightweight updates (patch parts holding only change patches without immediate rewrite; experimental around 23.3, documented as standard practice in 25.x, official guidance caps applicability at roughly 10% of rows) are modeling substitutes, not core hotspot mechanisms: deduplication is deferred to merges (with a window where stale versions are readable), and there is no automatic spreading or queueing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Application patterns and costs: never UPDATE hot state (inventory, counters) row by row — batch and re-insert new versions (cost: seconds-to-minutes freshness delay); aggregate the hot key&#x27;s change stream in the application or stream processor before bulk writes (cost: architectural complexity); for true OLTP row semantics use an OLTP store and keep ClickHouse analytical (cost: a dual-write/sync pipeline). Bottom line: high-frequency updates to one row have no confirmed native carrying path <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——system.* 表极丰富：query_log、processes、parts、merges、metrics、events、replicas、disks、mutations、query_thread_log、text_log、part_log；支持 Prometheus endpoint；OpenTelemetry span 可写入…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——<code>system.*</code> 表极丰富：query_log、processes、parts、merges、metrics、events、replicas、disks、mutations、query_thread_log、text_log、part_log；支持 Prometheus endpoint；OpenTelemetry span 可写入 <code>system.opentelemetry_span_log</code>。注意：自观测日志本身是 MergeTree 表，会吃磁盘，必须配 TTL/留存。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（opentelemetry.md）+ 社区实践。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — extremely rich system.* tables: query_log, processes, parts, merges, metrics, events, replicas, disks, mutations, query_thread_log, text_log, part_log; Promet…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — extremely rich <code>system.*</code> tables: query_log, processes, parts, merges, metrics, events, replicas, disks, mutations, query_thread_log, text_log, part_log; Prometheus endpoint; OpenTelemetry spans can be written to <code>system.opentelemetry_span_log</code>. Caveat: the self-observability logs are themselves MergeTree tables and eat disk — TTLs/retention are mandatory. Evidence: official docs (opentelemetry.md) + community practices.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——native TCP（9000/9440）与一等 HTTP(S) 接口（8123/8443）并存；HTTP 查询可以是完全无状态的单次请求，LB 友好；另有 MySQL（9004）/PostgreSQL（9005）wire 协议、JDBC/ODBC、gRPC、Arrow Flight。但没有 OLTP 式长事务会话语义；并发由 ma…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——native TCP（9000/9440）与一等 HTTP(S) 接口（8123/8443）并存；HTTP 查询可以是完全无状态的单次请求，LB 友好；另有 MySQL（9004）/PostgreSQL（9005）wire 协议、JDBC/ODBC、gRPC、Arrow Flight。但没有 OLTP 式长事务会话语义；并发由 <code>max_concurrent_queries</code>（默认 100/节点）、用户 quota/profile、内存限制控制，超限排队或直接拒绝/OOM——连接本身不是瓶颈，&quot;查询并发预算&quot;才是。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + 社区客户端指南。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — native TCP (9000/9440) alongside a first-class HTTP(S) interface (8123/8443); HTTP queries can be fully stateless single requests, LB-friendly; plus MySQL (90…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — native TCP (9000/9440) alongside a first-class HTTP(S) interface (8123/8443); HTTP queries can be fully stateless single requests, LB-friendly; plus MySQL (9004)/PostgreSQL (9005) wire protocols, JDBC/ODBC, gRPC, Arrow Flight. But there are no OLTP-style long-transaction session semantics; concurrency is governed by <code>max_concurrent_queries</code> (default 100/node), user quotas/profiles and memory limits — over the budget means queueing, rejection or OOM. Connections themselves are not the bottleneck; the &quot;query concurrency budget&quot; is. Evidence: official docs + community client guides.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">查证为无</span><p class=\"snippet\">查证为无——不提供 PostgreSQL/MySQL 式跨多语句、跨多表的通用 ACID 事务与标准隔离级别（读已提交/可重复读/可串行化均无）。单个 INSERT 的 block/part 写入具有原子可见性，但这不等于事务支持。这是 OLAP 追加写模型的设计选择，不是功能遗漏。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>查证为无</strong>——不提供 PostgreSQL/MySQL 式跨多语句、跨多表的通用 ACID 事务与标准隔离级别（读已提交/可重复读/可串行化均无）。单个 INSERT 的 block/part 写入具有原子可见性，但这不等于事务支持。这是 OLAP 追加写模型的设计选择，不是功能遗漏。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported — no PostgreSQL/MySQL-style general-purpose ACID transactions spanning multiple statements or tables, and none of the standard isolation levels (read commit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> — no PostgreSQL/MySQL-style general-purpose ACID transactions spanning multiple statements or tables, and none of the standard isolation levels (read committed/repeatable read/serializable). A single INSERT&#x27;s block/part write has atomic visibility, but that is not transaction support. This is a design choice of the OLAP append-write model, not a missing feature. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——ReplicatedMergeTree 以 part 为复制单位，Keeper（Raft，推荐 ≥3 节点）维护复制日志，副本异步拉取 part；默认最终一致，读非主副本可能读到旧状态。可用 insert_quorum 提高写入确认强度，但把副本/跨 AZ 延迟放进写路径，且 quorum 写在副本不足时直接失败（拿可用性换一…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——<code>ReplicatedMergeTree</code> 以 part 为复制单位，Keeper（Raft，推荐 ≥3 节点）维护复制日志，副本异步拉取 part；默认最终一致，读非主副本可能读到旧状态。可用 <code>insert_quorum</code> 提高写入确认强度，但把副本/跨 AZ 延迟放进写路径，且 quorum 写在副本不足时直接失败（拿可用性换一致性）；默认不写 RPO=0。Keeper 只做协调不存表数据；Keeper 与 ZooKeeper 快照格式不兼容，混搭 quorum 不支持。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（academic overview、Keeper 知识库）+ 社区实践。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — ReplicatedMergeTree replicates at part granularity; Keeper (Raft, ≥3 nodes recommended) holds the replication log, replicas pull parts asynchronousl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — <code>ReplicatedMergeTree</code> replicates at part granularity; Keeper (Raft, ≥3 nodes recommended) holds the replication log, replicas pull parts asynchronously; default is eventual consistency — reads on non-leader replicas can see stale state. <code>insert_quorum</code> strengthens write acknowledgement but puts replica/cross-AZ latency into the write path, and quorum writes fail outright when replicas are short (consistency bought with availability); RPO=0 is not claimed by default. Keeper coordinates only and stores no table data; Keeper and ZooKeeper snapshot formats are incompatible — mixed quorums unsupported. Evidence: official docs (academic overview, Keeper knowledge base) + community practices.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——手工/配置式 shard + replica 拓扑，Distributed 表做查询路由与结果聚合；存储可通过 storage policy 落到对象存储（存算分离方向），ClickHouse Cloud 走弹性计算路线。但自建经典集群&quot;加节点&quot;不等于&quot;自动再平衡&quot;：分片、数据迁移、流量切换要自己规划。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——手工/配置式 shard + replica 拓扑，<code>Distributed</code> 表做查询路由与结果聚合；存储可通过 storage policy 落到对象存储（存算分离方向），ClickHouse Cloud 走弹性计算路线。但自建经典集群&quot;加节点&quot;不等于&quot;自动再平衡&quot;：分片、数据迁移、流量切换要自己规划。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — manual/configured shard + replica topologies, Distributed tables for query routing and result aggregation; storage can land on object storage via storage poli…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — manual/configured shard + replica topologies, <code>Distributed</code> tables for query routing and result aggregation; storage can land on object storage via storage policies (disaggregation direction), ClickHouse Cloud goes the elastic-compute route. But on a classic self-managed cluster &quot;adding nodes&quot; is not &quot;automatic rebalancing&quot;: sharding, data migration and traffic cutover need planning. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持。数据文件落盘加密有引擎内机制（--enterprise-encryption 启动参数，多 store 需逐个配置；存储层 RFC 显示文件状态记录在 COCKROACHDB_REGISTRY）；备份可用 passphrase / KMS 加密。但 WAL / 临时文件的覆盖边界、密钥轮换与 KMS 矩阵需对照 v26.3 文档…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>。数据文件落盘加密有引擎内机制（<code>--enterprise-encryption</code> 启动参数，多 store 需逐个配置；存储层 RFC 显示文件状态记录在 <code>COCKROACHDB_REGISTRY</code>）；备份可用 passphrase / KMS 加密。但 WAL / 临时文件的覆盖边界、密钥轮换与 KMS 矩阵需对照 v26.3 文档复核。来源等级：官方文档（旧版本）+ 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported. On-disk data-file encryption has an in-engine mechanism (--enterprise-encryption startup flag, must be configured per store for multi-store setups; a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong>. On-disk data-file encryption has an in-engine mechanism (<code>--enterprise-encryption</code> startup flag, must be configured per store for multi-store setups; a storage-layer RFC shows file state recorded in <code>COCKROACHDB_REGISTRY</code>); backups can be encrypted with passphrase / KMS. But coverage boundaries for WAL / temp files, key rotation, and the KMS matrix need verification against v26.3 docs. Evidence level: official docs (older versions) + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。TLS 双向认证（节点证书 + 客户端证书），--insecure 仅限开发测试。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。TLS 双向认证（节点证书 + 客户端证书），<code>--insecure</code> 仅限开发测试。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Mutual TLS (node certificates + client certificates); --insecure is for development/testing only. Evidence level: official docs</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Mutual TLS (node certificates + client certificates); <code>--insecure</code> is for development/testing only. Evidence level: official docs</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持。PostgreSQL wire protocol v3 + 多数 PG 语法/工具可用，但不是 PG 内核。v26.3 官方文档明确缺口：range types、events、drop primary key、XML functions、列级权限、XA、template 建库、FDW、session-scoped advisor…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>。PostgreSQL wire protocol v3 + 多数 PG 语法/工具可用，但不是 PG 内核。v26.3 官方文档明确缺口：range types、events、drop primary key、XML functions、列级权限、XA、template 建库、FDW、session-scoped advisory locks（仅 transaction-scoped 支持）。来源等级：官方文档（v26.3）</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported. PostgreSQL wire protocol v3 + most PG syntax/tools work, but it is not a PG kernel. v26.3 official docs list explicit gaps: range types, events, drop…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong>. PostgreSQL wire protocol v3 + most PG syntax/tools work, but it is not a PG kernel. v26.3 official docs list explicit gaps: range types, events, drop primary key, XML functions, column-level privileges, XA, template databases, FDW, session-scoped advisory locks (only transaction-scoped supported). Evidence level: official docs (v26.3)</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（商业许可，非开源）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（商业许可，非开源）。Apache 2.0（2017–2019）→ BSL（2019–2024）→ CockroachDB Software License（2024–今）；2024-11 起年收入 &lt; $10M 组织免费 Enterprise；2026 起新版本源码私有。Cloud 按 RU/存储计费（Basic 层级含免费额度，第三…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（商业许可，非开源）</strong>。Apache 2.0（2017–2019）→ BSL（2019–2024）→ CockroachDB Software License（2024–今）；2024-11 起年收入 &lt; $10M 组织免费 Enterprise；2026 起新版本源码私有。Cloud 按 RU/存储计费（Basic 层级含免费额度，第三方口径，待官方复核）；自托管商业授权价格不公开（询价）。来源等级：官方博客 + 第三方报道 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Commercial license</span><p class=\"snippet\">Commercial license (not open source). Apache 2.0 (2017–2019) → BSL (2019–2024) → CockroachDB Software License (2024–present, free Enterprise for organizations under $10M …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Commercial license (not open source)</strong>. Apache 2.0 (2017–2019) → BSL (2019–2024) → CockroachDB Software License (2024–present, free Enterprise for organizations under $10M revenue since 2024-11); since 2026 new-version source is private. Cloud is billed by RU/storage (third parties report a free allowance for the Basic tier — pending official verification); self-hosted commercial license pricing is not public (request a quote). Evidence level: official blog + third-party statement + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（偏少）</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（偏少）（编辑判断）。官方文档以英文为主，中文社区实践帖远少于 OceanBase/TiDB。来源等级：编辑判断，待规模化采集验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持（偏少）</strong>（编辑判断）。官方文档以英文为主，中文社区实践帖远少于 OceanBase/TiDB。来源等级：编辑判断，待规模化采集验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (on the scarce side) (editorial judgment). Official docs are primarily English; Chinese community practice posts are far fewer than for OceanBase/TiDB…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported (on the scarce side)</strong> (editorial judgment). Official docs are primarily English; Chinese community practice posts are far fewer than for OceanBase/TiDB. Evidence level: editorial judgment, pending scaled data collection</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（用延迟换全球可用性；吞吐随节点线性扩展）。 单行读写延迟毫秒级（跨地域更高），高于单机 DB；吞吐随节点数线性扩展 官方文档。 follower reads / 就近 leaseholder 降低读尾延迟 官方文档。 热点行/高冲突事务是性能杀手，schema 设计需避免全局序列热点 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（用延迟换全球可用性；吞吐随节点线性扩展）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单行读写延迟毫秒级（跨地域更高），高于单机 DB；吞吐随节点数线性扩展 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>follower reads / 就近 leaseholder 降低读尾延迟 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>热点行/高冲突事务是性能杀手，schema 设计需避免全局序列热点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (trades latency for global availability; throughput scales linearly). Single-row read/write latency in milliseconds (higher across regions), above single-node D…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (trades latency for global availability; throughput scales linearly).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-row read/write latency in milliseconds (higher across regions), above single-node DBs; throughput scales linearly with node count <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Follower reads and nearby leaseholders cut read tail latency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Hot rows/high-contention transactions are the performance killer — schema design must avoid global-sequence hotspots <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（SOC2 Type II；国际合规为主）。 CockroachDB 公开 SOC2 Type II<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 无中国区服务/信创名录信息；中国用户需评估跨境合规 待验证。 自托管版的合规责任在部署方 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（SOC2 Type II；国际合规为主）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB 公开 SOC2 Type II<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>无中国区服务/信创名录信息；中国用户需评估跨境合规 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>自托管版的合规责任在部署方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (SOC2 Type II; international compliance focus). CockroachDB publishes SOC2 Type II <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. No China regions or trusted-innovation catalog…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (SOC2 Type II; international compliance focus).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB publishes SOC2 Type II <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>No China regions or trusted-innovation catalog information; Chinese users must assess cross-border compliance <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n<li>Self-hosted compliance is the deployer&#x27;s responsibility <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（2015 年开源；2023 年转 BSL 许可）。 2015 年开源；2023 年核心改 BSL 引发社区 fork 讨论 社区共识。 GitHub stars 数万级；Cockroach Labs 持续融资 社区共识。 Serverless/Standard/Dedicated 多形态，版本线需对准 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（2015 年开源；2023 年转 BSL 许可）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2015 年开源；2023 年核心改 BSL 引发社区 fork 讨论 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>GitHub stars 数万级；Cockroach Labs 持续融资 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless/Standard/Dedicated 多形态，版本线需对准 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (open-sourced 2015; moved to BSL in 2023). Open-sourced 2015; the 2023 core move to BSL sparked fork debates <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Tens of thousands of GitHub …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (open-sourced 2015; moved to BSL in 2023).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open-sourced 2015; the 2023 core move to BSL sparked fork debates <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Tens of thousands of GitHub stars; Cockroach Labs keeps raising <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless/Standard/Dedicated editions — align on the right one <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（新兴市场金融科技；案例少于 TiDB）。 公开案例以新兴市场金融科技、SaaS 为主<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 顶级互联网大厂公开案例少于 TiDB/Cassandra 社区共识。 选型参考：多活/全球部署是主要采用动因 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（新兴市场金融科技；案例少于 TiDB）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公开案例以新兴市场金融科技、SaaS 为主<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>顶级互联网大厂公开案例少于 TiDB/Cassandra <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>选型参考：多活/全球部署是主要采用动因 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (emerging-market fintech; fewer cases than TiDB). Public cases skew to emerging-market fintech and SaaS <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Fewer named hyperscaler c…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (emerging-market fintech; fewer cases than TiDB).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public cases skew to emerging-market fintech and SaaS <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Fewer named hyperscaler cases than TiDB/Cassandra <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Selection signal: multi-active/global deployment is the main adoption driver <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（CHANGEFEED 做 CDC；备份内置）。 CDC：CHANGEFEED（到 Kafka/云存储）官方文档。 备份：全量/增量内置，支持 PITR 官方文档。 迁移：MOLT（MySQL/Postgres→CRDB）等官方工具 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（CHANGEFEED 做 CDC；备份内置）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CDC：CHANGEFEED（到 Kafka/云存储）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>备份：全量/增量内置，支持 PITR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁移：MOLT（MySQL/Postgres→CRDB）等官方工具 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (CHANGEFEED for CDC; built-in backup). CDC: CHANGEFEED (to Kafka/cloud storage) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Backup: built-in full/incremental with PITR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (CHANGEFEED for CDC; built-in backup).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CDC: CHANGEFEED (to Kafka/cloud storage) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Backup: built-in full/incremental with PITR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Migration: official tools like MOLT (MySQL/Postgres→CRDB) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（CockroachDB Cloud（Serverless/Standard/Dedicated））。 Cloud Serverless（按量）/ Standard / Dedicated 三档 官方文档。 跨云部署（AWS/GCP）是特色 官方文档。 自建版与云版功能对齐，BSL 许可注意 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（CockroachDB Cloud（Serverless/Standard/Dedicated））。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloud Serverless（按量）/ Standard / Dedicated 三档 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云部署（AWS/GCP）是特色 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>自建版与云版功能对齐，BSL 许可注意 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (CockroachDB Cloud (Serverless/Standard/Dedicated)). Cloud Serverless (pay-per-use) / Standard / Dedicated tiers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cross-cloud deployment (AWS/GC…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (CockroachDB Cloud (Serverless/Standard/Dedicated)).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloud Serverless (pay-per-use) / Standard / Dedicated tiers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud deployment (AWS/GCP) is the specialty <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Self-hosted and cloud editions aligned; note the BSL license <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（IMPORT（CSV/Parquet/Avro）；PG COPY 兼容）。 IMPORT FROM 可从 S3/GCS/HTTP 批量导入 CSV/Parquet/Avro 官方文档。 PG 协议兼容，COPY、pg_dump/pg_restore 可用 官方文档。 大表 IMPORT 注意拆分与超时，并行度需实测 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（IMPORT（CSV/Parquet/Avro）；PG COPY 兼容）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IMPORT FROM 可从 S3/GCS/HTTP 批量导入 CSV/Parquet/Avro <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PG 协议兼容，COPY、pg_dump/pg_restore 可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大表 IMPORT 注意拆分与超时，并行度需实测 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (IMPORT (CSV/Parquet/Avro); PG COPY compatible). IMPORT FROM bulk-loads CSV/Parquet/Avro from S3/GCS/HTTP <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PG-protocol compatible: COPY, pg_dump…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (IMPORT (CSV/Parquet/Avro); PG COPY compatible).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IMPORT FROM bulk-loads CSV/Parquet/Avro from S3/GCS/HTTP <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PG-protocol compatible: COPY, pg_dump/pg_restore work <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Split large IMPORTs and watch timeouts; parallelism needs real testing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（多为付费墙内）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（多为付费墙内）。sql.log.user_audit / sql.log.admin_audit.enabled 等 cluster settings 存在（官方 skills 仓库的 CIS 审计样例报告可证）；具体自托管 / Cloud 各 tier 的能力边界待官方复核。来源等级：官方仓库资料 + 待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（多为付费墙内）</strong>。<code>sql.log.user_audit</code> / <code>sql.log.admin_audit.enabled</code> 等 cluster settings 存在（官方 skills 仓库的 CIS 审计样例报告可证）；具体自托管 / Cloud 各 tier 的能力边界待官方复核。来源等级：官方仓库资料 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (mostly behind a paywall). sql.log.user_audit / sql.log.admin_audit.enabled cluster settings exist (confirmed by a CIS audit sample in the official skills repo)…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (mostly behind a paywall)</strong>. <code>sql.log.user_audit</code> / <code>sql.log.admin_audit.enabled</code> cluster settings exist (confirmed by a CIS audit sample in the official skills repo); exact capability boundaries across self-hosted / Cloud tiers pending official verification. Evidence level: official repo materials + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（IMPORT 读外部存储；无 FDW/外部表）。 可从外部存储 IMPORT，但那是导入不是联邦查询 官方文档。 无 postgres_fdw 等外部表机制 社区共识。 跨库查询需求一般在应用层或用 CDC 同步后解决 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（IMPORT 读外部存储；无 FDW/外部表）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可从外部存储 IMPORT，但那是导入不是联邦查询 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 postgres_fdw 等外部表机制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>跨库查询需求一般在应用层或用 CDC 同步后解决 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (IMPORT reads external storage; no FDW/external tables). Can IMPORT from external storage, but that is ingestion, not federated querying (official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (IMPORT reads external storage; no FDW/external tables).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Can IMPORT from external storage, but that is ingestion, not federated querying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No postgres_fdw-style external table mechanism <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-database queries are typically solved in the app layer or via CDC sync <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（CHANGEFEED 一等公民：Kafka/云存储/webhook）。 CHANGEFEED 可把行级变更推到 Kafka、云存储（Parquet/CSV）、webhook 官方文档。 支持 Avro/JSON 信封，可做下游流处理 官方文档。 大事务变更 feed 延迟与内存是已知调优点 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（CHANGEFEED 一等公民：Kafka/云存储/webhook）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CHANGEFEED 可把行级变更推到 Kafka、云存储（Parquet/CSV）、webhook <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>支持 Avro/JSON 信封，可做下游流处理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大事务变更 feed 延迟与内存是已知调优点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (First-class CHANGEFEED: Kafka/cloud storage/webhook). CHANGEFEED streams row changes to Kafka, cloud storage (Parquet/CSV) and webhooks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Avro/J…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (First-class CHANGEFEED: Kafka/cloud storage/webhook).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CHANGEFEED streams row changes to Kafka, cloud storage (Parquet/CSV) and webhooks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Avro/JSON envelopes for downstream stream processing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Changefeed lag and memory on huge transactions are known tuning points <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生 TTL；靠 scheduled job 定时删）。 无原生行级 TTL，需用 scheduled job 机制跑定时 DELETE 官方文档。 大表定时删注意拆批，避免长事务拖慢 MVCC GC 社区共识。 原生 TTL 的 feature request 长期 open，短期别指望 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生 TTL；靠 scheduled job 定时删）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生行级 TTL，需用 scheduled job 机制跑定时 DELETE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大表定时删注意拆批，避免长事务拖慢 MVCC GC <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>原生 TTL 的 feature request 长期 open，短期别指望 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native TTL; scheduled jobs for periodic deletes). No native row-level TTL; use scheduled jobs running periodic DELETEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Batch large deletes to…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native TTL; scheduled jobs for periodic deletes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native row-level TTL; use scheduled jobs running periodic DELETEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Batch large deletes to avoid long transactions slowing MVCC GC <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The native-TTL feature request has been open for years; don&#x27;t count on it soon <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（声明式在线 schema 变更，并发友好）。 schema 变更是在线声明式的，多语句可并发执行不阻塞读写 官方文档。 大表加索引是后台分布式回填，前台无感 官方文档。 极端场景下 schema 变更仍可能排队，变更期间避免混用 DDL+DML 大事务 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（声明式在线 schema 变更，并发友好）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>schema 变更是在线声明式的，多语句可并发执行不阻塞读写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大表加索引是后台分布式回填，前台无感 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>极端场景下 schema 变更仍可能排队，变更期间避免混用 DDL+DML 大事务 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Declarative online schema changes; concurrency-friendly). Schema changes are declarative and online; multiple statements run concurrently without blocking read…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Declarative online schema changes; concurrency-friendly).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Schema changes are declarative and online; multiple statements run concurrently without blocking reads/writes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Index backfills on huge tables are distributed background work, invisible to foreground traffic <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>In edge cases schema changes can queue; avoid mixing DDL with huge DML transactions during changes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（admission control 有限；无租户资源组）。 admission control 做过载保护，但不是租户级 QoS 官方文档。 多租户靠多集群/多 database 逻辑隔离 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（admission control 有限；无租户资源组）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>admission control 做过载保护，但不是租户级 QoS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多租户靠多集群/多 database 逻辑隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Limited admission control; no tenant resource groups). Admission control guards against overload, but it is not tenant-level QoS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Multi-tenancy v…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Limited admission control; no tenant resource groups).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Admission control guards against overload, but it is not tenant-level QoS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Multi-tenancy via multiple clusters/databases for logical isolation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（多 region 生存目标，原生多活）。 REGIONAL BY ROW 等生存目标，数据放离用户近的 region 官方文档。 多 region 写原生支持，follower 读降低跨区读延迟 官方文档。 跨区事务延迟是物理上限，设计表时要分区裁剪 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（多 region 生存目标，原生多活）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>REGIONAL BY ROW 等生存目标，数据放离用户近的 region <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多 region 写原生支持，follower 读降低跨区读延迟 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区事务延迟是物理上限，设计表时要分区裁剪 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Multi-region survival goals; native active-active). Survival goals like REGIONAL BY ROW pin data near users <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Native multi-region writes; follow…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Multi-region survival goals; native active-active).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Survival goals like REGIONAL BY ROW pin data near users <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Native multi-region writes; follower reads cut cross-region read latency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region transaction latency is a physics limit — design tables for partition pruning <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Raft 自愈，RTO 秒级）。 Raft 多副本，节点故障自动选主，RTO 秒级 官方文档。 RPO=0（多数派提交），脑裂靠 Raft 任期防护 官方文档。 多活架构下单节点故障业务几乎无感 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Raft 自愈，RTO 秒级）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Raft 多副本，节点故障自动选主，RTO 秒级 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RPO=0（多数派提交），脑裂靠 Raft 任期防护 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多活架构下单节点故障业务几乎无感 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Raft self-healing; seconds of RTO). Raft multi-replica; failed nodes trigger automatic re-election in seconds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RPO=0 (majority commit); Raft te…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Raft self-healing; seconds of RTO).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Raft multi-replica; failed nodes trigger automatic re-election in seconds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RPO=0 (majority commit); Raft terms guard against split-brain <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>In active-active setups single-node failure is nearly invisible to traffic <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});